  "description": "They were once heroes - warriors, mages, defenders of the realm. \n\nBut when they stood against the wrong kings, they were cast out, erased from history.\n\nYet they endure.\n\n\nIn ruins and shadows, they gathered again. \n\n\n    No banners. \n\n           No glory. \n\n                    Only a vow:\n\n    “Remember what was forgotten”\n\nSome call them ghosts. Others believe they’re long dead.\n\nBut when their blade finds you, you&#039;ll know:\n                                \n      The Forgotten have returned",
